## Expected Impact (Math)

### Before Fix (Current):
```
Spatial: 1.00 × 0.5 = 0.50
Volumetric: 0.00 × 0.3 = 0.00   ← BLOCKED
Latent: 0.50 × 0.2 = 0.10
Total: 0.60 → 0.599 < 0.60 → MaxLoopSafety ❌
```

### After Fix:
```
Spatial: 1.00 × 0.5 = 0.50
Volumetric: 0.50 × 0.3 = 0.15   ← Discovery Pass + Shield Floor
Latent: 0.50 × 0.2 = 0.10
Total: 0.75 > 0.60 → Rule1_HighConfidencePass ✅
```

